        "heading": "Cut",
        "text": "<p>The way a diamond is cut is the most important of the 4C's. Cut refers to the angles and proportions of a diamond, which determines the diamonds beauty, brightness, sparkle and scintillation.</p><p>A perfectly cut diamond can sparkle 3-4 times more than the average diamond, this is because every facet that is cut correctly will reflect light out the top of the diamond, creating maximum sparkle.</p>"
