        "heading": "Clarity",
        "text": "<p>The clarity of a diamond, relates to the amount of inclusions found within the diamond. Inclusions are non-crystallised carbon marks found within a diamond when the the diamond was formed 3 billion years ago.</p><p>The fewer inclusions a gemstone has, the higher its clarity grade and the more valuable it is.</p>"
